{"parse": {"title": "Emotes", "pageid": 2201, "revid": 23356, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Emotes</b> were added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\"><b>Update 9</b></a>. They are dances or movements you can do in game. The majority can be bought from <b>All Force</b> with Trophies inside the Leaderboard Area.\n</p><p>Equip emotes through the <b>Profile</b> menu in the right side of your screen.\n</p><p>Press <b>X</b> or <b>Period</b> on the keyboard to open up the <b>emote menu</b>.\n</p><p>List of Emotes:\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Emote\n</th>\n<th>Cost\n</th>\n<th>Where to obtain\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Laugh\n</td>\n<td>50 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Griddy\n</td>\n<td>Free\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flex\n</td>\n<td>200 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Penguin Dance\n</td>\n<td>100 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Clap\n</td>\n<td>Free\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Die Lit\n</td>\n<td>100 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gang Dance\n</td>\n<td>100 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Terrified\n</td>\n<td>50 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Facepalm\n</td>\n<td>Free\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waiting\n</td>\n<td>15 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sit\n</td>\n<td>Free\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WRYYYYY!\n</td>\n<td>50 Trophies\n</td>\n<td>All Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chainsaw Dance\n</td>\n<td>1000 Bullets\n</td>\n<td>Makimo\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>One Handed Pushup\n</td>\n<td>Premium Tier 14\n</td>\n<td>Cloud Pass\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snowball Throw\n</td>\n<td>Premium Tier 45\n</td>\n<td>Cloud Pass\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Idol\n</td>\n<td>Tier 50 (?)\n</td>\n<td>Cake Pass II\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vacation\n</td>\n<td>Premium Tier 60\n</td>\